<h1>Your investment has completed</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Your investment in the <strong><%= @plan.name %></strong> plan has reached
  the end of its term, and the principal has been returned to your available
  balance.
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Principal returned: <%= number_to_currency(@investment.principal_amount) %></li>
  <li>Total profit earned: <%= number_to_currency(@investment.total_profit_earned) %></li>
  <li>Start date: <%= @investment.started_at.to_date %></li>
  <li>Completed: <%= @investment.completed_at.to_date %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  You can view the full performance breakdown at any time:
  <%= link_to "View investment", investment_url(@investment) %>
</p>

<p>Thank you for investing with us.</p>
